  "body": "**Original comment by Michael Ezra (Bitbucket: [Michael Ezra](https://bitbucket.org/Michael Ezra), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nThis worked:\n\n1. I copied ART.exe to ART installation directory\n2. replaced liblensfun.dll with the copy I had in C:\\\\msys64\\\\mingw64\\\\bin\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/1840691087-image.png)\nNow it works!  \nThe lensfun version numbers are a bit confusing: \n\n* my version is 0.3.2 which seems to be more current \\(117 KB\\) ,\n* yet version 0.3.95 \\(591KB\\) is mentioned as an older Alpha: [https://lensfun.github.io/](https://lensfun.github.io/)\n\nAny idea which is a more suitable version?\n",
